OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on #30m scheme to cut
OL,4,Asewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a #30m project
OL,7,Faimed at reducing sewage spills in
OL,8,FLincolnshire.
OL,10,FAnglian Water said it was upgrading its
OL,11,Fsewage treatment works in Boston with a
OL,12,Fnew storm tank, capable of holding 4.5
OL,13,Fmillion litres of water, and installing
OL,14,Fan extra pump at East Side Pumping
OL,15,FStation to reduce wastewater overflows
OL,16,Fduring heavy rainfall.
OL,18,FThe company said it also planned to
OL,19,Finstall an ultraviolet (UV) treatment
OL,20,Fsystem at the site in 2028 to reduce
OL,21,Fbacteria in treated wastewater.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
